title: Addressing the Deficit
new-page: true
is-card: true
on-arrival: addressing_the_deficit_timer += 3; month_actions += 1
view-if: Finance_minister_party != 'PPS' and government_action == 'Addressing the Deficit'
card-image: img/PolishNationalFundBank.jpg
tags: leg_politics

= Addressing the Deficit

Finance Minister, [+ finance_minister +] ([+ finance_minister_party +]), has decided to approach the deficit in our treasury. What would his policy be?

- @streamline: Streamline our tax collection agency to prevent fraud.
- @printmoney: Print more money to fill the deficit.
- @welfarecut: Cut social spending.
- @taxrich: Tax the rich.

@streamline
subtitle: +0.5 budget
unavailable-subtitle: [? if upper_tax_rates > 6 : Taxes are already too high ?][? if taxrich_timer > 0 : ,  The Finance Minister isn't interested in this option right now. ?]
on-arrival: taxrich_timer += 12
choose-if: upper_tax_rates <= 5; taxrich_timer == 0

@printmoney
subtitle: +3 budget
unavailable-subtitle: [? if upper_tax_rates > 6 : Taxes are already too high ?][? if taxrich_timer > 0 : ,  The Finance Minister isn't interested in this option right now. ?]
on-arrival: taxrich_timer += 12
choose-if: upper_tax_rates <= 5; taxrich_timer == 0
                                                                                
@welfarecut
subtitle: +1 Budget
unavailable-subtitle: [? if welfare < -5 : There is nothing left to cut ?][? if welfarecut_timer > 0 : ,  The Finance Minister isn't interested in this option right now. ?]
on-arrival: welfarecut_timer += 8
choose-if: welfare >= -5; welfarecut_timer == 0

The Finance Minister has decided to approach this option and has now submitted it for the Sejm to vote on.

- @welfarecutno: Vote against the motion.
- @welfarecutyes: Support the motion.

@welfarecutno
                                                                           
@welfarecutyes                                                                         

@taxrich
subtitle: +2 budget
unavailable-subtitle: [? if upper_tax_rates > 6 : Taxes are already too high ?][? if taxrich_timer > 0 : ,  The Finance Minister isn't interested in this option right now. ?]
on-arrival: taxrich_timer += 12
choose-if: upper_tax_rates <= 5; taxrich_timer == 0
                                                                                
